div class=\"message\"><br /> Oh, well, shit. That's interesting.</div> </div> </div> </div>Of course it is interesting. The panic was ultimately the result of society combining various fears about the changing society of the 80s and 90s into one grand fear that ruined the lives of innocent people. I can see how Beast and Hunter would have some thematic connections to that era.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Despite the user name I am actually bigender.<br /> <br /> My Savannah Setting for CofD can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/959455-the-young-man-in-the-cafe-s-savannah-georgia-setting-writeup\" target=\"_blank\">here</a><br /> <br /> My heroes as monster tamers rules for BtP can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/975230-heroes-as-monster-tamers-rules-ideas\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3932-the-young-man-in-the-cafe","name":"The young man in the cafe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3932_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-29T17:23:57-07:00","id":1085628,"title":"","content":"Bring back Golden Age of Piracy and Wild West Geist. Who wouldn't want Pirate Crew Krewes dealing with Davy Jones' locker and krackens dealing with similarities to bottom of the underworld or Ghostly Skeleton Banditos that walk down the devil's crossroads?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5557-runcible","name":"Runcible","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5557_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"164"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-02T23:58:20-07:00","id":1087029,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The young man in the cafe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1085156-dark-eras-2-call-for-eras-kickstarter?p=1085545#post1085545\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Of course it is interesting. The panic was ultimately the result of society combining various fears about the changing society of the 80s and 90s into one grand fear that ruined the lives of innocent people. I can see how Beast and Hunter would have some thematic connections to that era.</div> </div> </div> </div> Of course, in CofD there probably were killer cults running around.<br /> <br /> Might be a bit too on the nose for a Slasher or Inferno setting","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/391-stsword","name":"StSword","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar391_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1635"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-03T04:14:35-07:00","id":1087096,"title":"","content":"I humbly submit these for Backers to consider: <ol class=\"decimal\"><li>Werewolf/Hunter: Baltic Crusades, Livonian and Prussian specifically.</li> <li>Inferno: Early Protestant Reformation in England and Germany.</li> <li>Mage/Promethean: Prague during reign of Rudolph II.</li> <li>Mage: Late 18th century Bavaria.</li> <li>Werewolf: French and Indian War.</li> <li>Vampire/Hunter: Prohibition era New York/Chicago.</li> </ol><br /> <br /> I had written more detailed explanations about each one but my browser crashed and I can't be bothered to write them out again now, maybe later.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11522-the_1990","name":"the_1990","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"42"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-03T20:29:13-07:00","id":1087490,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>StSword</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1085156-dark-eras-2-call-for-eras-kickstarter?p=1087029#post1087029\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Of course, in CofD there probably were killer cults running around.<br /> <br /> Might be a bit too on the nose for a Slasher or Inferno setting</div> </div> </div> </div>Slasher in the 80s is for hunter. The 80s was the golden age of slasher movies, so NOT giving them part of an 80s dark era would be a big oversight.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Despite the user name I am actually bigender.<br /> <br /> My Savannah Setting for CofD can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/959455-the-young-man-in-the-cafe-s-savannah-georgia-setting-writeup\" target=\"_blank\">here</a><br /> <br /> My heroes as monster tamers rules for BtP can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/975230-heroes-as-monster-tamers-rules-ideas\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3932-the-young-man-in-the-cafe","name":"The young man in the cafe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3932_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-05T01:06:02-07:00","id":1088139,"title":"","content":"- Qin Dynasty Vampire: Covenants based on the 100 Schools of Thought, <span style=\"font-family:inherit\">The Legalist Covenant (which in addition to bureaucratic governance of vampires is also the culture's &quot;we are monsters who are supposed to keep humanity in line through fear&quot; faction) is beginning to enforce 'Shu' (the Masquerade) on the rest of the Kindred. The Confucian Covenant (feudal rule + serving as active &quot;ancestors&quot; with filial relationships with living family and necromantically with the passed) is fighting back HARD.</span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:inherit\">-Changeling/Mage Golden Age of Islam (Mage I can budge on, Changeling I won't.... 1001 Nights!!! </span>Scheherazade<span style=\"font-family:inherit\"> was take during the Sassanid Empire but returned to the strange new world of Abbasid Caliphate shaped by the stories that kept her alive in her Durance to birth a new court system)</span><br /> <br /> - Birth of the Haudenosaunee Hunter: enforce the Great Law against cannibal Witch cults at the behest of Hiawatha and the Great Peacemaker themselves<br /> <br /> - Dante's Florence Geist, ideally with updated Inferno (there's shit going down in the local underworld with the corruption of the dead into lemures)<br /> <br /> - French Revolution Mage: the outbreak of the Nameless War; can be done as a crossover with Mummy (for focus on the rulers and ruled dynamic) or Beast (for focus on the Terror)<br /> <br /> - Chicago Worlds Fair - Mass Crossover: Nameless War is cresting, science and culture are wed to imperialism and eugenics of the Seers but the Great Refusal is around the corner; those eugenic experiments create Deviants; the Current Wars may draw God Machine and Principle into the frey; Vampires lurke in the intrigue and Shadows of the World's Fair; while one of history's greatest Slashers carries out his work...<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-06T20:52:30-07:00","id":1088991,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>blackhatmatt</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1085156-dark-eras-2-call-for-eras-kickstarter?p=1085428#post1085428\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Oh, well, shit. That's interesting.</div> </div> </div> </div>I brought this idea up almost a year ago, I thought I was spitballing at the time but I think it could legimately work, especially with Young Man In The Cafe's idea of adding Hunter to it.<br /> <br /> You have cases like the McMartin Preschool, the West Memphis Three, the Franklin Coverup to work with. You have the idea that all these missing children are supposedly captured by occult slave rings, you have parents spreading stories like wildfire and getting small rural Bible Belt towns whipped up into frenzies. You can have the Long Night getting involved and making things even worse. Not to mention all the Heroes that will arise from all the &quot;will someone think of the children!&quot; in the air.<br /> <br /> And then of course there could be all the young Beasts who could suddenly find themselves in the crosshairs of the very community that was once trying to protect them....<br /> <br /> I think it's important to remember that a lot of the people involved in the Satanic Panic are still around and lost jobs and lives due to the accusations spreading around the time so sensitivity on that matter will be obviously be important. But it's such a perfect setting for a Beast and Hunter crossover.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11643-corax","name":"Corax","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"80"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-10T13:31:29-07:00","id":1090843,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Corax</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1085156-dark-eras-2-call-for-eras-kickstarter?p=1088991#post1088991\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I think it's important to remember that a lot of the people involved in the Satanic Panic are still around and lost jobs and lives due to the accusations spreading around the time so sensitivity on that matter will be obviously be important. But it's such a perfect setting for a Beast and Hunter crossover.</div> </div> </div> </div>One of the more bizarre aspects of the entire thing is that it is possible to draw a direct line from the Satanic child abuse panic of the early 80s to the Oklahoma City bombing in 1995. When Janet Reno was Florida State Attorney for Dade County, she helped pioneer a lot of the questionable techniques used by prosecutors in these alleged child abuse cases. The publicity she gained for herself in these high profile cases allowed her to (unsuccessfully) run for Governor of Florida, bring her to the attention of national Democratic Party members and eventually become the Attorney General under President Clinton. As such, she authorized the FBI assault of the Branch Davidian compound in Waco, TX, with a major justification being that the children there were allegedly being sexually abused. Timothy McVeigh would cite the Waco incident as one of the primary motivators in his terrorist bombing of the Alfred P. Murrah Federal Building. It's somewhat depressing how much damage can be directly or indirectly wrecked in the name of &quot;won't someone please think of THE CHILDREN&quot;. <br /> <br /> But, for the purposes of CoD, one can go slightly mad trying to figure out which, if any, supernatural force or faction might have started the satanic abuse panic entirely as part of a far reaching conspiracy to ... increase the powers of Federal law enforcement in the US? Discredit political philosophies that advocate smaller government? Push more gun control legislation to disarm their prey? Assassinate some low level bureaucrat who would've been a major tool of the God Machine*? Or maybe it's just all random circumstance after all?<br /> <br /> Also, it occurs to me that this panic was, IIRC, one of the things that influenced the creation of the original Nightmare on Elm Street film. So, potential Slasher tie in. <br /> <br /> Not sure if there'd be a tasteful way to work Innocents into it or not. <br /> <br /> <br /> *<sub>I admit a near total lack of familiarity with Demon, so this may or may not be a valid motivation for an overly complicated and long reaching conspiratorial plot.</sub>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>What is tolerance? It is the consequence of humanity. We are all formed of frailty and error; let us pardon reciprocally each other's folly. That is the first law of nature.</i><br /> Voltaire, &quot;Tolerance&quot; (1764)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12890-no-one-of-consequence","name":"No One of Consequence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12890_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-10T21:06:57-07:00","id":1090973,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>No One of Consequence</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1085156-dark-eras-2-call-for-eras-kickstarter?p=1090843#post1090843\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">*<sub>I admit a near total lack of familiarity with Demon, so this may or may not be a valid motivation for an overly complicated and long reaching conspiratorial plot.</sub></div> </div> </div> </div>You nailed it <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1059-azahul","name":"Azahul","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1465"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}